  "question": "Can CiNii source-emitted Japanese university-library OPAC records, their public BOOKデータASP/openBD content-enhancement blocks, or openBD itself expose a usable table of contents or Chapter 9/10/11 pagination for the exact 2009 《冀淑英古籍善本十五讲》?",
  "answer": "No usable contents/page evidence is exposed on the tested current anonymous routes. CiNii NCID BB00252412 identifies the exact 2009 241-page ISBN 9787501340637 object and source-emits OPAC OpenURL routes. Kyoto University, Tenri University and Ritsumeikan return exact anonymous holdings/detail pages; UTokyo currently returns HTTP 202 with an empty body. Kyoto source directly emits both openBD and BOOKデータASP callbacks for the exact ISBN/bibid, while Ritsumeikan emits BOOKデータASP. Headless Chrome launched from the stable source-emitted OpenURL within one browser session executes those callbacks: Kyoto renders '目次・あらすじの電子情報はありません。' in openBD and 'あらすじ・目次の情報はありません。' in BOOKデータASP; Ritsumeikan renders the same BOOKデータASP no-information result. The official public openBD ISBN GET independently returns HTTP 200 with JSON [null] (6 bytes). These are current route-scoped content-enhancement boundaries only and do not prove the physical book lacks a contents page. Chapter 9 exact pagination/direct text and Chapter 10/11 exact pagination remain unresolved.",
